    "title" "CFP + Renovatio Compatibility Patch"
    "changenote" "[h2]Maintenance & History Update - Version 1.18.3[/h2]\n\n[list]\n[*]Updated decisions, events, traits, religions, scripted effects, graphics, localization, and map data for CK3 1.19.\n[*]Corrected invalid syntax, obsolete fields, broken references, missing localization, and decision tooltips.\n[*]Improved Western Roman restoration state handling, integration effects, and army setup.\n[*]Added historically researched title histories for the Western Roman Empire, Bosporan Kingdom, Gallic Empire, Imperial Pontificate, and Carausian Britannia.\n[*]Added supporting historical characters, families, dynasties, claims, and sourced epithets.\n[*]Improved compatibility references used by the official Immersive Toponyms patch.\n[/list]\n\n[b]Important:[/b] Start a new campaign to see newly added static title and character history. Existing saves do not import history files retroactively."
    "description" "[h1]CFP + Renovatio Compatibility Patch[/h1]\n\nCompatibility patch for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2220098919]Community Flavor Pack[/url], and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3798537678]Renovatio[/url].\n\n[h2]Why this patch[/h2]\n\nCommunity Flavor Pack and Renovatio both ship their own versions of the same gene and portrait-modifier files. Because CK3 uses file-level replacement for these files, loading both mods silently drops one mod's clothing, headgear, legwear, and visual traits. This patch merges both mods' content into a single set of files so nothing is lost.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n\n[h2]Requirements[/h2]\n\n[list]\n[*]Community Flavor Pack\n[*]Renovatio\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Load Order[/h2]\n\n[list=1]\n[*]Community Flavor Pack\n[*]Ethnicities & Portraits Expanded\n[*]CFP + EPE Compatibility Patch\n[*]Renovatio\n[*][b]CFP + Renovatio Compatibility Patch[/b]\n[/list]\n\nStart a new campaign after installing this patch. If clothing, headgear, or visual traits look wrong, report your complete playset, load order, and CK3 version."
    "previewfile" "C:\Users\ruben\Desktop\EoE_mod_dev\EoE+compatches\other_mods\cfp-reno-compatch\thumbnail.png"
}

